      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      467.17,
      539.88,
      502.24
    ],
    "text": "The Order made under Section 9(1) (a) of the aforesaid Act designating \u201c Kottawa \u2013 Kothalawala Section of OuterCircular National Highway (from 0.000 km to 9.900 km)\u201d as an Expressway, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1848/6of February 3, 2014 is hereby rescinded without prejudice to anything done thereunder.",
